Introduction
************

 After  a  long  time,  I'm  glad  to  announce an all NEW and very MUCH
 enhanced release of  'AddressAssist'  (AA).  AA  is  a  powerful,  full
 featured address management program. It is definitively *not* YAAM (Yet
 Another Address Manager), as it combines a lot of well  known  features
 in  one  program  and  adds  some  new  posibilities  to  ease  Address
 Management. Take a look at  the  most  important  program  features  as
 listed below.

 Give AA a chance. Address data from other AM may easily be used in AA!

 Thank you and enjoy.


 Alex H. Schneider


Main features
*************

 *  16 field address database including 4 user definable text fields,  a
    'group'-field  to  distinguish  up  to  10  record  groups  and  two
    additional multi-line remark fields  with  unlimited  field  length.

 *  Intuitive  user  interface  (MUI),  including  a  nice  image-button
    toolbar.

 *  Professional workspace, consisting of  a Database list  view  and  a 
    Record form view.

 *  Selections of records. Selected records may be viewed,  printed  and
    exported  separately. Powerful filters (field string match and group
    match filters) are provided.

 *  Powerful printing: output Address Lists and (multi columned)  Labels
    Sheets  with  flexible  text  style and format; including Header and
    Footer lines on every page. Ability to Load and Save print-setup.

 *  ARexx interface. All functions available through the  GUI  are  also
    supported  in  ARexx. Freely configurable ARexx menu for easy access
    to AREXX scripts.

 *  Sports record links: link records to other records.

 *  Easy  database  navigation  through  'QuickAccess' -buttons  on  the
    toolbar or through the Listview.

 *  Extensive use of MUI's Bubble-Help feature!

 *  Record templates for simplified data input.

 *  Powerful  database  sort feature including multiple sort indices and
    directions.

 *  Flexible Import/Export filters for  ASCII  files.  Freely  definable
    file   format.   Exchange   data  with  all  famous  Wordprocessors,
    Spreadsheets and Database applications on the Amiga  and  all  other
    platforms. Ability to Load and Save of ASCII-Transfer setup.

 *  Data exchange through AMIGA clipboard.

 *  Special function for removing identical records.

 *  Optional:  Direct  exchange  of address data with Casio SF series of
    palmtop computers using a serial link cable (available separately at
    the author).


Language Support
****************

 Localized under WB2.1 and above. Built-in language is  English.  German
 and  norsk  catalog  translations, as well as empty catalog description
 files are provided. Italian and french translations are incomplete, the
 translation  files  are  provided.  Documentation  is available only in
 english. However, there is extensive Online-help  available  in  german
 and  norsk in the form of Bubble-Help!

 To spread AA all over the world, it would be nice to  support  as  many
 languages  as  possible.  If  you are interested in providing a catalog
 file translation and a short readme file for AddressAssist in your  own
 language, please contact the author BEFORE starting to translate.


Shareware: Restrictions in Demo release, Registration
*****************************************************

 This Demo release is restricted to 15 records only, which  is the  only
 difference  to  the full version. This way, you are easily able to test
 this piece of software. If you like it, then please register to get the
 Key-File,  which  removes  the  restriction  in  this  and *all* future
 versions of AA.

 See  the  'Orderform.txt'  for  further  informations  on  registration
 conditions and pricing.

 By  registering,  you support the Author and encourage him in a further
 development of the software. Thank you for supporting Shareware.


